.         * DEPENDENT VARIABLE: left-wing political attitudes
.         * -----------------------------------------
.                 gen Left = 10*(10-plh0004) if plh0004>=0 & plh0004<=10 /* rev
> ersed scale + rescaled into 0-100*/
(17,862 missing values generated)

