.         
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * 
. 
.         * We test whether people having a daughter as the first child have mo
> re left-leaning political attitudes than those having son as their first chil
> d
.         * We run a random effects model with:
.         * Dependent var: left political attitudes
.         * Main predictor: first_daughter
.         * Controls: year of birth of the 1st child (centred on the grand mean
> )
.         
.         
.         xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2005 to 2019, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

.         xtreg Left first_daugh c.Cbrth_y_first##c.Cbrth_y_first , re cluster(
> pid)

